# Wave 121 §B, AF629 — `bolt-player.state`'s mirror: seat 1 (ai, bob) holds priority and a castable
# Lightning Bolt instead of seat 0. `human…`/`ai…` keys land on seat 0/seat 1 regardless of who is
# actually sitting there (`e2e/play/scenario.ts`), and this harness always seats two real browsers,
# so bob idling here runs HIS clock while alice's sits stopped — the one state `bolt-player.state`
# itself never reaches, needed to read the opponent's clock colour from alice's own screen.
